### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts


### Get one contact
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a99f57a42af901158c0647c


### Create a contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Bob",
    "lastName": "Thankoe",
    "email": "bob@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "red",
    "birthday": "1995-09-14"
}


### Update a contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a99f72042af901158c0647f HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Martha",
    "lastName": "Otasowie",
    "email": "martha@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "green",
    "birthday": "1995-01-01"
}


### Delete a contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/6aa479b3412579a3e0d39b1b HTTP/1.1